      <div class="footer-workshop">
        <p class="footer-eyebrow">About Abacus Campers</p>
        <h2>Local, Experienced &amp; Passionate<br />About Getting You Back on the Road</h2>
        <p class="footer-copy-placeholder">Based in Dublin 11, Abacus Campers is a local, independent workshop specialising in the repair, servicing and upgrade of all types of campers and motorhomes. Whether it's a simple service or a full restoration, we apply the same care and attention to every job.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="footer-trust-points">
        <li><span class="footer-trust-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M6 12h7l3-4h9v5l4 3v10H13l-4-5H4v-9Zm11-4V4m-5 0h10M4 16H1m0-5v12" /></svg></span><div><h3>All Makes &amp; Models</h3><p>From classic campers to modern motorhomes.</p></div></li>
        <li><span class="footer-trust-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="m16 3-5 12-5 8 8-2 2 8 3-8 7 2-5-8ZM16 3v18" /></svg></span><div><h3>Honest Advice</h3><p>Clear communication and practical solutions.</p></div></li>
        <li><span class="footer-trust-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="m16 3 4 4 6 1-1 6 3 5-5 3-2 7-5-3-5 3-2-7-5-3 3-5-1-6 6-1Z" /><path d="m11 16 4 4 7-9" /></svg></span><div><h3>Quality Workmanship</h3><p>Trusted by motorhome owners across Dublin and beyond.</p></div></li>
      </ul>
